      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765892829496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Centralized repo, testing and deployment delays, \ndeployment for unrelated changes\nAs you scale, deployments, even code \npulls can take ages\nCentrally dependent on Ops team to \nmake sure and manually validate that there is \nno backdoor created (security loophole)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Centralized repo, testing and deployment delays, \ndeployment for unrelated changes\nAs you scale, deployments, even code \npulls can take ages\nCentrally dependent on Ops team to \nmake sure and manually validate that there is \nno backdoor created (security loophole)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
