      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GIT Change log/change files -> \nInfer which streams changed \nand run DAB for only those streams",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GIT Change log/change files -> \nInfer which streams changed \nand run DAB for only those streams",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gia40KjOUAM2KeSI7S_4V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1527.3878300245296,
      "y": 6948.851364919988,
      "width": 2185.919677734375,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 625232819,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 840486675,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767956554530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Domain = 1 DAB will result in deployment of everything within that domain every time = high time in deployment and testing\n1 stream = 1 devops pipeline means for every work request change, multiple devops pipeline needs to be executed\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 Domain = 1 DAB will result in deployment of everything within that domain every time = high time in deployment and testing\n1 stream = 1 devops pipeline means for every work request change, multiple devops pipeline needs to be executed\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aPF0ArHsv7TH_xl8e8Hmc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1531.85059274786,
      "y": 7133.728262702841,
      "width": 1637.0700409473613,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 648868179,
      "version": 91,
      "versionNonce": 49509555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767956554530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 domain = 1 devops pipeline, with multiple DAB gives flexibility to deploy in one go and only\ndeploy the streams that are only changed",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 domain = 1 devops pipeline, with multiple DAB gives flexibility to deploy in one go and only deploy the streams that are only changed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
